      "tier": "tooltip",
      "text": "Passive: Twisted Fate gains 15/25/35/45/55% Attack Speed and every 4th Attack deals an additional (65/90/115/140/165 + (20% bonus Attack Damage) + (40% Ability Power)) magic damage. 50% effective against structures.",
      "variant": null
    },
    {
